WEBVTT

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:30.956
exercise --

00:02:30.956 --> 00:02:31.996
even surgery.

00:02:32.956 --> 00:02:36.196
In 1998, the category of orthorexia,

00:02:36.196 --> 00:02:38.556
the obsessive focus on healthy eating,

00:02:38.556 --> 00:02:42.276
was coined as a new category
of eating disorder.

00:02:43.476 --> 00:02:44.796
During this pandemic,

00:02:44.796 --> 00:02:49.116
social media followed the journeys
of celebrities documenting weight loss

00:02:49.116 --> 00:02:50.476
and other transformations.

00:02:51.196 --> 00:02:54.916
Idealized body types
aren’t just about thinness anymore.

00:02:55.636 --> 00:02:57.436
New forms of thin --

00:02:57.436 --> 00:02:59.716
lean, muscular bodies --

00:02:59.716 --> 00:03:02.116
have come to be pursued across gender,